                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d543252c-a8d4-3075-8897-580687877fef",
                        "entry_id": "44dde053-944f-333d-ab47-ad2ccb556f17",
                        "glosses": [
                            "холодное оружие ударно-дробящего действия в виде металлического шарика, снабжённого шипами; использовался в качестве навершия булав, палиц или кистеней/гасил"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c46b9d91-12e1-4349-9151-60c75190538a",
                                "sense_id": "d543252c-a8d4-3075-8897-580687877fef",
                                "text": "Если противнику удавалось сдержать натиск копейщиков, их обязанностью было пройти между передними рядами, которые раздвигались, открывая им выход, и ввязаться в бой. К ним присоединялись воины с двуручными мечами, моргенштернами («утренними звездами»), и «люцернскими молотами», оружием страшно эффективным в рукопашном бою."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "57b49d2c-4aef-4f89-a9da-3897959b2524",
                        "source_entry_id": "44dde053-944f-333d-ab47-ad2ccb556f17",
                        "source_sense_id": "d543252c-a8d4-3075-8897-580687877fef",
                        "target_lang_word": "morning star",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "morning star",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bae199a0-a6a1-30a8-b808-25c1db9e0054",
                                        "entry_id": "ab34f3d4-6ff7-3b98-8259-be44045dd412",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The planet Venus as observed in the eastern sky around dawn."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "11fb5952-65e0-4d02-9276-a557236184ab",
                                                "sense_id": "bae199a0-a6a1-30a8-b808-25c1db9e0054",
                                                "text": "Near-synonyms: evening star, Hesperus"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d6c4b967-9941-4928-bd7f-b80cf724f2ef",
                                                "sense_id": "bae199a0-a6a1-30a8-b808-25c1db9e0054",
                                                "text": "The evening star is the morning star. (Hesperus is Phosphorus.)"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d76e7e1b-f7fb-43f3-bf10-8ad0f9dac392",
                                                "sense_id": "bae199a0-a6a1-30a8-b808-25c1db9e0054",
                                                "text": "Morn in the white wake of the morning star / Came furrowing all the orient into gold."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9a0c9ea2-710a-4e28-aaab-1cbe8e394fc4",
                                                "sense_id": "bae199a0-a6a1-30a8-b808-25c1db9e0054",
                                                "text": "1979, Paul Williams and Kenneth Ascher, “The Rainbow Connection”, The Muppet Movie, Henson Associates and ITC Entertainment\nWho said that every wish would be heard and answered / When wished on the morning star? / Somebody thought of that, and someone believed it / And look what it's done so far."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4426b058-c056-308e-a1cb-51b17b4986ab",
                                        "entry_id": "ab34f3d4-6ff7-3b98-8259-be44045dd412",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The planet Mercury as observed in the eastern sky around dawn."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncommon"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "10436188-62ed-4d19-b429-00b878502259",
                                                "sense_id": "4426b058-c056-308e-a1cb-51b17b4986ab",
                                                "text": "Near-synonyms: evening star, Hermes"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "morning star",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2bcf9464-a90d-361c-896c-7876c1edc102",
                                        "entry_id": "fbcb7703-71e9-3b60-b46f-23add625e827",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A weapon consisting of a heavy ball set with spikes attached rigidly to a staff, in contrast to a flail."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bdb6221c-558c-4a37-a271-0ee5c46574ee",
                                                "sense_id": "2bcf9464-a90d-361c-896c-7876c1edc102",
                                                "text": "Contrivances like these, except that the balls were armed with spikes, were long carried by the pioneers of the trained bands, or city militia, they are generally called morning stars."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ccd995e7-fee2-3666-9dad-e230db80dd07",
                                        "entry_id": "fbcb7703-71e9-3b60-b46f-23add625e827",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sleep or rheum, particularly that which is discharged at the eyes during sleep."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Hong-Kong",
                                            "Philippines",
                                            "uncommon",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "58ee0cc7-162d-4b63-aeb6-5f51a1721d9b",
                                                "sense_id": "ccd995e7-fee2-3666-9dad-e230db80dd07",
                                                "text": "2019, PlaysPH, \"What is the official name of the crusty stuff we develop around our eyes during sleep? And what causes it?\", Quora\nWe call it “morning star”. Funny name though. The real name is “eye crusts”."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d996128e-a1de-4456-bdd8-b38514ef425b",
                        "source_entry_id": "44dde053-944f-333d-ab47-ad2ccb556f17",
                        "source_sense_id": "d543252c-a8d4-3075-8897-580687877fef",
                        "target_lang_word": "Morgenstern",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Morgenstern",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "85323a02-fee2-3aa5-a17c-87f33276d6ec",
                                        "entry_id": "dd99f84f-0f26-3788-bb70-cde12fd835bf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Bezeichnung für den Planeten Venus am östlichen Morgenhimmel"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "nur Singular"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f58e650c-8774-44b0-9415-40febe6fe9f8",
                                                "sense_id": "85323a02-fee2-3aa5-a17c-87f33276d6ec",
                                                "text": "„Nur der Blick jener geheimnisvollen Augen leuchtete noch in seinem Gehirne fort, und zwar auch während des nächtlichen Schlafes, bis der Morgenstern am Himmel glänzte, dessen Licht seine Augenlider berührt haben mochte; denn er sah es unmittelbar, als er aufwachte.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d1e3201b-c661-443c-863c-1e87e582b56d",
                                                "sense_id": "85323a02-fee2-3aa5-a17c-87f33276d6ec",
                                                "text": "„Der Morgenstern war fast verschwunden, und der Mond hing ungewöhnlich schwer und gelb direkt über der Landzunge.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "10900a72-687c-3729-826c-3a78c3a941e5",
                                        "entry_id": "dd99f84f-0f26-3788-bb70-cde12fd835bf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "mittelalterliche Hiebwaffe, Stab mit einer spitzenbesetzten Eisenkugel"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0459a97d-20c9-4a63-bcbc-d0c0475a7b8e",
                                                "sense_id": "10900a72-687c-3729-826c-3a78c3a941e5",
                                                "text": "„Dies Epitaphium, an das alle Wulffenschen Erinnerungen anknüpfen, ist ein großes und sehr in die Augen fallendes Denkmal. Degen, Flinte, Streitaxt, Lanze, Sponton, Lochaberaxt, Morgenstern, Keule, Streitkolben, Pauke, Trommel etc. bilden eine Art Trophäe, die, wie die Strahlen einer Kriegsglorie, das leidlich gemalte Portraitbild des alten Wulffen umzirken.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c5bb9bdb-ff7d-4d6d-8be8-51e8a18e7464",
                                                "sense_id": "10900a72-687c-3729-826c-3a78c3a941e5",
                                                "text": "Der Krieger war mit Kampfaxt und Morgenstern bewaffnet."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b3da3a53-a627-41aa-8f43-b14e485266ee",
                                                "sense_id": "10900a72-687c-3729-826c-3a78c3a941e5",
                                                "text": "„Wir verkrochen uns dort hinter merkwürdigen Pflanzen; sie waren stachlig wie riesige Disteln und trugen schwere Früchte, die mir wie zackige Morgensterne ins Gesicht schlugen.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
